== Assignments
- Assignment 1: Build a linear regression and logistic regression on [https://archive.ics.uci.edu/ml/datasets/iris Iris] and [https://archive.ics.uci.edu/ml/datasets/Computer+Hardware Computer Hardware] dataset. If you can build it from the bottom rather than just use the integrated package, you will get a higher credit.
- Assignment 2: Build a softmax classifier on [https://archive.ics.uci.edu/ml/datasets/iris Iris] dataset and a 3-layer neural network on [http://yann.lecun.com/exdb/mnist/ MNIST] dataset. If you can build it from the bottom rather than just use the integrated package, you will get a higher credit.
- Final Project: Finish a complete project using deep learning *individually*. The project on your own major will be recommended.

== Grading Policy
The tentative weightages for each component of the course are as follows:
- Attendance (10%)
- Assignments 1 (10%)
- Assignments 2 (10%)
- Final project and presentation (70%)
- Assignment 1 and Assignment 2 oral presentation (Extra 10%)

*NOTE*: This course does not have an end-semester examination. Instead, there will be a project evaluation towards the end of the course.

